  <Properties>
    <blockList>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "41914047-aec3-497f-a8bd-fd6b8fabb894",
      "key": "51101a52-a42b-47d3-8277-467bccffeb36",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe 42nd Annual General Meeting of Stoolball England took place on Monday 7th March 2022 at 7pm via Zoom.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe following were elected:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPresident - Kay Price\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EChairman - Gwynn Griffith\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EVice-chair - Anita Broad\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EHon. Secretary - \u003Cem\u003EVacant\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EMinutes Secretary - Sophie Dunn\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EHon. Treasurer - Georgie Harrison\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPress \u0026amp; Publicity Officer - \u003Cem\u003EVacant\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EOfficers - Genevieve Gordon, Sophie Dunn, Megan James, Laura Day, Richard Emsley, Wendy Heal, Kelvin Speirs\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA number of topics were discussed. They were:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ECoaching programme\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EStoolball England Matches - The meeting decided not to hold them this year.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EInsurance/DBS checks - These items are still being administered by Richard Emsley this year.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EYoung players\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ERules review\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EThe Role of Stoolball England as a National Governing Body\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAnyone interested in becoming Hon. Secretary or Press \u0026amp; Publicity Officer, please send an email to info@stoolball.org.uk\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "settingsData": [
